            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[If Barnes & Noble Press still won’t load after a retry, the downloader now shows Sign In so you can reconnect and resume report downloads.
]]></description>
